  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your psi-like abilities grow with your experience.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Psi-Like Ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your racial psi-like ability has a manifester level equal to your character level plus your mythic tier. In addition, you can use your racial psi-like ability a number of times per day equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can take this feat multiple times, each time choosing another racial psi-like ability that has been improved by Improve Psi-Like Ability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc31\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
